<title>GERMANY: Veba plans U.S. share listing.</title>
<headline>Veba plans U.S. share listing.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>German diversified utility Veba AG said on Wednesday it planned to further widen its shareholder base by listing on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Veba said it plans to list its shares on the NYSE on October 8 this year. It said no capital raise was planned in connection with the listing.</p>
<p>--Clifford Coonan, Frankfurt Newsroom +4969 756525</p>
